{"branch":"영천점","html":"<p class=\"kd-intro\">영천점의 위치와 주변 교통편을 확인하세요.</p><div class=\"kd-map-slot\" data-kakao-src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-58adf3a0cde0ece6.html\" style=\"height:398px\"><p class=\"kd-map-pending\" role=\"status\">위치 지도를 준비하고 있습니다.</p><template><iframe class=\"kd-map-frame\" width=\"640\" height=\"398\" style=\"height:398px\" loading=\"lazy\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" title=\"영천점 카카오맵 지도\" src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-58adf3a0cde0ece6.html\"></iframe></template></div><noscript><style>.kd-map-slot{display:none}</style><p class=\"kd-note\">위의 지도 이미지와 아래 주소를 기준으로 위치를 확인해 주세요.</p></noscript><p class=\"kd-address\"><strong>주소</strong><span>경기 화성시 동탄구 동탄순환대로 704 성산에이타워 4층 403호</span></p><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 정류장</h3><ol class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-number\">1</span><span>이주택지.상록.경남아파트</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">2</span><span>상록.경남아파트.이주택지</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">3</span><span>퍼스트파크.이지더원</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">4</span><span>퍼스트파크.이지더원</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">5</span><span>동탄파크이지더원.자이후문</span></li></ol></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 버스</h3><dl class=\"kd-buses\"><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">광역</span></dt><dd><span>M4137</span><span>M4137(예약)</span><span>M4448</span><span>M4448(예약)</span><span>서울01(평일)(출근)</span><span>서울01(평일)(퇴근)</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">일반</span></dt><dd><span>116-3</span><span>116-5</span><span>15-1</span><span>206</span><span>5-2(수원역6번출구,AK플라자-아이원,호수자이파밀리에)</span><span>5-3</span><span>712</span><span>73</span><span>H102</span><span>H2</span><span>18(호수자이파밀리에-LH1단지,한양수자인)</span><span>710</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">마을</span></dt><dd><span>19-3</span><span>H102</span><span>H11</span><span>H5(심야)</span><span>동탄2순환(A)</span><span>동탄2순환(B)</span><span>H15</span><span>동탄2순환(E)</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bu